    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "** EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY** REFERENCES REQUIRED**\r\n\r\nBROE auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this exceptionally large two bedroom 2nd  floor apartment extending to c.80 sq m. The apartment comprises of entrance hallway, spacious and bright living/dining area with balcony off, fully fitted kitchen. Two large double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes, master en suite  and main bathroom. Designated parking for one car with ample visitors spaces. G.F.C.H. Great location:  Situated within easy access to Sandyford Industrial Park, M50 and a host of local amenities including  Blackglen Village Centre and Creche. It also benefits from the 114 Bus route and is within walking distance of Dundrum Town Centre, & Marlay Park. Our exclusive letting agency, BROE auctioneers, highly recommends a visit to view this exceptional property. \r\n\r\nIf you are interested, please contact our lettings agent, Shauna OBrien, today to register your interest. Furthermore, you can also stay updated on our new listings by following us on Instagram and Facebook at BROE auctioneers."
      },
